    <statement><p>Let <m>f(x) = \displaystyle 4x\sin^{-1}\mathopen{}\left(x\right)</m>.  Find <m>f'(x)</m>.</p>
<p><m>f'(x) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Find <m>f'( 0.3 )</m>.</p>
<p><m>f'( 0.3 ) =</m><fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4\sin^{-1}\mathopen{}\left(x\right)+4x\frac{1}{\sqrt{1-x^{2}}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
